    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1008">

                <pb facs="0978" n="812" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg812"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.105/38</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Chargé Mayer
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-27T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 27, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 10, noon.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d1008-f1"/> Amendment therein referred
                    to has been consummated and put into effect by an exchange of notes dated August
                    25 from Department to Haitian Legation, answered by Haitian Legation in their
                    note of August 29. Department’s November 16, 3 p.m. instructs you to conclude
                    second modification.</p>
                <p>Keep Department advised of progress.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
